                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "232628663",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561199084524868",
                            "num_reviews": 106,
                            "playtime_forever": 24,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 23,
                            "last_played": 1788231932
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game costing money is lowkey beyond me.\r\n\r\nI got it 85% off for $1.75, and honestly, this is one of those games where you just had to be there kinda vibe.\r\nYou ever have an Xbox 360, but your parents either A) didn’t care about games, B) couldn’t afford games, or hell, probably both? So you didn’t really have any games to play, and instead you spent your time playing demos of games like ScreamRide or Trials HD.\r\nThis game gives me that exact same vibe.\r\nSo while I wouldn’t necessarily say it’s a bad game, I think it’s just outdated. It feels like one of those random Xbox 360-era demos you’d play for hours simply because it was one of the few things you had.",
